  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HEARD research 2011-2017 - HEARD Research</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">HEARD research 2011-2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta &#xe4;r ett fas II st&#xf6;d till Health Economics and AIDS Research      Divisions (HEARD), Durban, Sydafrika, forskningsstrategi 2011-2015.   Kunskap och evidens f&#xf6;r p&#xe5;verkan: Integrera hiv-arbete med m&#xe4;nsklig   utveckling. Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let &#xe4;r: att bidra till produktion av   kunskap och utnyttjande av kunskap och evidens som st&#xf6;djer att        integration av h&#xe4;lsa, hiv och m&#xe4;nsklig utveckling i &#xf6;stra och s&#xf6;dra A</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase II support to HEARDs strategy 2011- 2015 Knowledge and Evidence for Impact: Integrating HIV Response with Human Development. The      overall goal is: to contribute to the production of knowledge and     utilisation of knowledge and evidence which support integrating       health, HIV and human development responses in East and Southern      Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Contribute to the production of knowledge and utilization of knowledge and evidence which support integrating health, HIV and human development responses in East and Southern Africa&quot; (tentative new overall objective: &quot;To achieve health equity across the continent by meeting Africa&apos;s health challenges of today and tomorrow&quot;)</narrative>
  </description>
